# Secrets and credentials
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# Never commit API keys, secrets, or DPAPI-encrypted credentials
**/apikey.txt
**/api-key*
**/*.dpapi
secrets.json
*.env
.env
.env.*

# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# OptiRoute-specific
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# opencode editor local session cache (per-user, not project data)
.opencode/

# Local app data (config + DPAPI secrets) is per-user
# These go to %APPDATA%\OptiRoute\ by design — not in repo
config.local.json

# Publish artifacts from local builds (single-file releases go to GitHub Releases)
/publish/
/publish2/
/release/
*.exe
*.pdb
*.deps.json

